   (fellowship number PBEZP1-122976); the European Biosphere 3D open source
   virtual globe team who designed 3D tree models specifically for the
   Kimberley project; the Columbia Basin Trust 16R65260 (Stewart Cohen);
   the Geospatial Research Centre at Selkirk College (GEOIDE) 16R65906,
