   Dixon, P. Grady, Ft Hays State Univ, Werth Coll Sci Technol \& Math, Hays, KS 67601 USA.
   Kalkstein, Adam J., US Mil Acad, Dept Geog \& Environm Engn, West Point, NY 10996 USA.
   Allen, Michael J., Old Dominion Univ, Dept Polit Sci \& Geog, Norfolk, VA USA.},
